<h2>Chapter map</h2><p>RECORDED REGTEST / VALIDATED-V1 / UNLISTED. Select actual recorded block slabs, inspect transactions and outputs, and replay acknowledged A/B/C snapshots. Observation time unknown. This is not a live node. Each chapter has a primary station; book status and visual exercises are separate. WASD walks, arrows turn, 1-7 selects stations, M toggles the chapter map, R steps replay, / finds an identifier. Touch: left side walks, right side looks. Escape exits to Worlds.</p><table><caption>All 125 chapters</caption><thead><tr><th>Chapter</th><th>Station</th><th>Book status</th><th>Visual exercise</th></tr></thead><tbody>
